''A debt does not close by the closing of the hand that owed it.'' The meme and grammar hearths' OWED entries move here, re-measured against the tree on 2026-09-13 and re-stated as ''open'' or ''closed, with the evidence''. The historical rows keep each debt as it stood AT CLOSE; this block carries subsequent receipts and the Codex succession below. A reader who wants only "what still stands" reads this block and nothing else.

